Z||000000||vietnow||11-27-2000||06:45 PM||||On my thanksgiving trip from north alabama to northern illinois, i was traveling through either illinois or kentucky (dont remember, long trip) and saw this pretty big place on the highway called fiero factory or something like that... i checked the parking lot and around the building there were quite a few (half dozen or more) fieros parked out there.. i have been interested in buying a fiero for a while, and was just curious if anyone had heard of this place...<P>just wondering...<P>but in your opinion, which year fiero is the most reliable, and upgradable.<P>and are there any aftermarket turbo's for the fiero?<P>and what is the stock hp torque and such of the fiero? GT and other models too(dont know much about the fiero..)<BR><P>------------------<BR>Vietnow --||||reg||5
